'''Devil Wife''' (デヴィル夫人, ''Deviru Fujin'', '''Lady Devil''') is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] variant of [[Celeboodle]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. She was added in [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]].

