==Enemy==
This devil of a poodle is very similar to the [[Celeboodle|original]], being a single-target glass cannon with low range and a relatively high money drop. It is worth noting that her base attack power is almost ''double'' that of Celeboodle's, and while it matters little against meatshield, the Level 1 [[Death Surge]] gives her a pseudo-Area Attack that can nuke any oncoming units vulnerable to Surges in a matter of seconds.

==Strategy==
Treat Devil Wife as a shorter-ranged, single-target version of [[Condemned Peng]], but with lower health and higher damage. Her Surge spawn area doesn't reach as far as Condemned Peng's, but is still long enough to reach your backliners. Therefore it is best to bring plenty of [[:Category:Cats with Surge Immunity|Surge-immune units]] when you fight Devil Wife, especially in swarms. [[Ancient Egg: N003 (Special Cat)|Cat Cactus]] in particular is Strong Against Aku and Immune to Surges, able to survive long enough to finish her at higher levels.

Much like Celeboodle and [[Mistress Celeboodle]], it's recommended to exploit her high money drop with [[:Category:Cats with Money Up ability|units that have the Money Up ability]], such as a [[Talents|Talented]] [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]].

